---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {
  Camera, Lightbulb, QrCode, Store, Tag, CreditCard, ArrowUpRight,
} from '@lucide/astro';

const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Altis Çözümler",
  "description": "Altis Teknoloji çözümleri: TrueScan, Pick-to-Light, Asset Yönetimi, RFID Perakende ve Tag&Trace."
};
---

<Base
  title="Çözümler | Altis Teknoloji"
  description="Depo, saha ve varlık operasyonları için Altis Teknoloji çözümleri: TrueScan, Pick-to-Light, Asset Yönetimi ve daha fazlası."
  {schema}
  lang="tr"
  alternateUrl="https://www.altis.com.tr/en/solutions/"
>
  <section class="hub-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Çözümler</div>
      <h1>Sahadaki işi hızlandıran, doğrulayan ve kayda alan uygulamalar.</h1>
      <p>Altis çözümleri belirli operasyon problemlerine odaklanır: toplama hatasını azaltmak, varlıkları izlemek ve saha ekiplerine net iş akışı vermek.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hub-list">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="featured-row">
        <a class="hub-card hub-card-big" href="/cozumler/goruntu-isleme/">
          <div class="card-head">
            <span class="card-icon"><Camera size={26} stroke-width={1.7} /></span>
            <span class="card-tag">Görüntü işleme</span>
          </div>
          <h2>TrueScan</h2>
          <p>Mevcut kameralara entegre AI okuma motoru ile metal parlama, kirli etiket ve düşük kontrast koşullarında %99.5 doğrulukla barkod ve 2D/QR okuma.</p>
          <div class="card-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 480 240" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="ts-bg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
                  <stop offset="0" stop-color="#EEF3FF" />
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#E8FAFD" />
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="240" rx="10" fill="url(#ts-bg)" />
              <rect x="40" y="40" width="280" height="160" rx="8" fill="#fff" stroke="#D5DEF0" />
              <g transform="translate(60, 70)">
                {Array.from({ length: 14 }).map((_, i) => (
                  <rect x={i * 17} y="0" width={i % 3 === 0 ? 6 : 3} height="80" fill="#00125C" />
                ))}
              </g>
              <rect x="58" y="160" width="244" height="22" rx="3" fill="#EEF3FF" />
              <circle cx="380" cy="80" r="42" fill="#18B7D6" opacity=".18" />
              <circle cx="380" cy="80" r="22" fill="#18B7D6" opacity=".35" />
              <rect x="346" y="140" width="100" height="6" rx="3" fill="#00125C" opacity=".3" />
              <rect x="346" y="156" width="76" height="6" rx="3" fill="#00125C" opacity=".18" />
              <text x="346" y="190" font-family="Inter, sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#18B7D6">99.5% ✓</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span class="card-link">İncele <ArrowUpRight size={14} stroke-width={2.2} /></span>
        </a>

        <div class="featured-small-stack">
          <a class="hub-card" href="/cozumler/pick-to-light/">
            <div class="card-head">
              <span class="card-icon"><Lightbulb size={22} stroke-width={1.7} /></span>
              <span class="card-tag">Depo operasyonu</span>
            </div>
            <h2>Pick-to-Light</h2>
            <p>Işıklı yönlendirme ile toplama, ayrıştırma ve hat besleme süreçlerinde hız ve doğruluk.</p>
            <span class="card-link">İncele <ArrowUpRight size={14} stroke-width={2.2} /></span>
          </a>
          <a class="hub-card" href="/cozumler/asset-yonetimi/">
            <div class="card-head">
              <span class="card-icon"><QrCode size={22} stroke-width={1.7} /></span>
              <span class="card-tag">Varlık takibi</span>
            </div>
            <h2>Asset Yönetimi</h2>
            <p>NFC, QR ve mobil uygulama ile ekipman, zimmet ve servis kayıtlarını sahadan yönet.</p>
            <span class="card-link">İncele <ArrowUpRight size={14} stroke-width={2.2} /></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row-three">
        <a class="hub-card" href="/urunler/rfid-perakende/">
          <div class="card-head">
            <span class="card-icon"><Store size={22} stroke-width={1.7} /></span>
            <span class="card-tag">Perakende</span>
          </div>
          <h2>RFID Perakende</h2>
          <p>Mağaza, tünel, kasa ve sevkiyat senaryolarına özel RFID çözümleri ve entegre donanım.</p>
          <span class="card-link">İncele <ArrowUpRight size={14} stroke-width={2.2} /></span>
        </a>

        <a class="hub-card" href="/platformlar/tag-trace/">
          <div class="card-head">
            <span class="card-icon"><Tag size={22} stroke-width={1.7} /></span>
            <span class="card-tag">Platform</span>
          </div>
          <h2>Tag&Trace</h2>
          <p>RFID, barkod ve saha cihazlarını tek merkezden orkestre eden uçtan uca izlenebilirlik platformu.</p>
          <span class="card-link">İncele <ArrowUpRight size={14} stroke-width={2.2} /></span>
        </a>

        <a class="hub-card hub-card-dark" href="https://roxcard.com.tr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <div class="card-head">
            <span class="card-icon card-icon-dark"><CreditCard size={22} stroke-width={1.7} /></span>
            <span class="card-tag card-tag-dark">Dijital Kimlik</span>
          </div>
          <h2>Rox Card</h2>
          <p>NFC ve QR teknolojisiyle çalışan yeni nesil dijital kartvizit platformu. Tek dokunuşla paylaş, panelden yönet.</p>
          <span class="card-link card-link-dark">roxcard.com.tr <ArrowUpRight size={14} stroke-width={2.2} /></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
.hub-hero {
  padding: 96px 0 52px;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f6f8fc 0%, #fff 100%);
}
.hub-hero .eyebrow {
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--cyan);
}
.hub-hero h1 {
  max-width: 900px;
  margin-top: 18px;
  font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px);
  line-height: 1.08;
}
.hub-hero p {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 19px;
  color: var(--text-muted);
}

.hub-list { padding: 40px 0 100px; }

/* ============ FEATURED ROW (asymmetric) ============ */
.featured-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.55fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.featured-small-stack {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 20px;
}

/* ============ ROW 3 ============ */
.row-three {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
}

/* ============ CARD BASE ============ */
.hub-card {
  display: grid;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 26px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 14px;
  background: #fff;
  color: var(--text);
  align-content: start;
  transition: border-color .18s, box-shadow .18s, transform .18s;
}
.hub-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--cyan);
  box-shadow: 0 24px 50px -28px rgba(0, 18, 92, .28);
  transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.card-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.card-icon {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--bg-blue);
  color: var(--primary);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: background .18s, color .18s;
}
.hub-card:hover .card-icon {
  background: rgba(24, 183, 214, .14);
  color: var(--cyan);
}
.card-tag {
  font-size: 11.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--text-faint);
}

.hub-card h2 {
  font-size: 26px;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--primary);
  letter-spacing: -.01em;
  margin: 0;
}
.hub-card p {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.55;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  margin: 0;
}

.card-link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 5px;
  margin-top: auto;
  padding-top: 8px;
  font-size: 13.5px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--cyan);
  transition: gap .18s, color .18s;
}
.hub-card:hover .card-link { gap: 9px; }

/* ============ BIG CARD ============ */
.hub-card-big {
  padding: 32px;
  gap: 14px;
}
.hub-card-big h2 { font-size: 34px; }
.hub-card-big p { font-size: 16px; max-width: 540px; }
.card-visual {
  margin-top: 8px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  background: #fff;
}
.card-visual svg { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

/* ============ DARK CARD ============ */
.hub-card-dark {
  background: linear-gradient(150deg, #00125C 0%, #0A1E75 100%);
  border-color: transparent;
  color: #fff;
}
.hub-card-dark:hover {
  border-color: var(--cyan);
  box-shadow: 0 24px 60px -28px rgba(24, 183, 214, .55);
}
.hub-card-dark h2 { color: #fff; }
.hub-card-dark p { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, .78); }
.card-icon-dark {
  background: rgba(24, 183, 214, .18);
  color: var(--cyan);
}
.hub-card-dark:hover .card-icon-dark {
  background: rgba(24, 183, 214, .28);
  color: #fff;
}
.card-tag-dark { color: var(--cyan); }
.card-link-dark { color: var(--cyan); }

/* ============ RESPONSIVE ============ */
@media (max-width: 1000px) {
  .featured-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .featured-small-stack { grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-auto-flow: column; }
  .row-three { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .hub-hero { padding: 72px 0 40px; overflow: hidden; }
  .hub-hero h1{font-size:clamp(34px,10vw,44px);overflow-wrap:break-word;}
  .hub-hero p { font-size: 17px; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  .featured-small-stack { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto auto; grid-auto-flow: row; }
  .row-three { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hub-card { padding: 22px; }
  .hub-card-big { padding: 24px; }
  .hub-card-big h2 { font-size: 28px; }
  .hub-card h2 { font-size: 22px; }
}
</style>
